---
description: Enforce strict TypeScript + Vue + NestJS coding standards
alwaysApply: true
---

# 🚫 TypeScript 强约束

- NEVER use `any`
- NEVER use implicit any
- ALWAYS define return types for exported functions
- Prefer interface over type for object structures

# 🧩 Code Style

- Use const over let
- Use arrow functions
- Use early return instead of nested if
- Avoid deeply nested logic

# 📦 Import Rules

- Use absolute imports if configured
- Sort imports logically (builtin → third-party → internal)

# 🖼 Vue 规范

- Use <script setup lang="ts">
- Define props with defineProps and types
- Avoid Options API

# 🧱 NestJS 规范

- Use DTO for request validation
- Use class-validator
- Controller must be thin
- Business logic must be in service

# 🚀 Quality

- Code must pass ESLint without errors
- Code must follow Prettier formatting
- Do not generate pseudo code or incomplete logic
